# Simplified Chinese catalogue for the QS Matching Platform.
#
# Most user-facing strings in this codebase are written in Simplified
# Chinese at the source, so they need no entry here. What does need one is
# every model choice label: those are English msgids, and an untranslated
# msgid falls through to the page, which is how a buyer ended up reading
# "Company incorporation" inside a Simplified Chinese sentence.
#
# Entries left blank on purpose: the internal console. Those pages are read
# by staff, not by buyers, and translating them would hide which strings
# still need a translator's eye.
